<details class="lab-details"><summary>Export, verify and replay an episode</summary><p>The file stays on your device. Verification checks consistency with this implementation; it does not verify authorship. A replay never overwrites the live experiment. Limit: 1 MiB, 1,001 commands, nesting depth 16.</p><div class="actions"><button id="lab-export" class="button button-ghost" disabled>Export episode v2 ↓</button><button id="lab-export-v1" class="button button-ghost" disabled>Export legacy snapshot v1 ↓</button></div><label class="file-label" for="lab-import">Choose a v2 episode JSON <input type="file" accept=".json,application/json" id="lab-import" disabled/></label><p id="lab-import-status" role="status">No recorded episode loaded.</p><label for="lab-frame">Recorded command / frame</label><input id="lab-frame" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0" disabled/><pre id="lab-replay-frame">No verified frame.</pre></details>
<details class="lab-details"><summary>Experiment 1 · revisable model versus frozen model</summary><p>Only the revision policy changes. The supplied map, sensor, BFS order, movement costs and physical guard are identical. Compare both policies with and without the same intervention. The frozen policy detects contradictions but does not correct its map.</p><button id="lab-compare-revision" class="button button-primary" disabled>Compare revision policies</button><div id="revision-comparison" class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="Revision-policy comparison results"></div><p class="muted">Four deterministic runs are four conditions—not four independent statistical samples. A prevented move is counted separately from a successful movement.</p></details>
<details class="lab-details"><summary>Experiment 2 · BFS tie-breaking, a different question</summary><p>This comparison changes only neighbor order: east/south/west/north versus north/west/south/east. Both policies revise their model. This does not replace the revision-policy experiment.</p><label for="lab-compare-change">Environment <select id="lab-compare-change" disabled><option value="changed">Changed before first step</option><option value="initial">Initial world</option></select></label><button id="lab-compare-tie" class="button button-ghost" disabled>Compare BFS tie-breaks</button><div id="tie-comparison" class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="BFS tie-breaking comparison results"></div></details></div>
<p class="method-note">Method: programmer-supplied prior map · local observation · uniform-cost BFS · explicit model revision. No training, awareness, autonomous concept acquisition or general scientific superiority is demonstrated. <a href="/research/notes/reproducibility.html">Read the limitations.</a></p></div></section>
